            "description": "# rav\n\nA cross-platform approach to executing shortcut commands.\n\n\n## Create a `rav.yaml` file\n\n`rav.yaml`\n```\nscripts:\n    echo: echo \"this is awesome\"\n    server: venv/bin/python -m http.server\n```\n\n\n## Run a script\n\n```\nrav echo\n```\n\nor\n    \n```\nrav server\n```\n",
